# Feature folders created here by PM agent
# Structure: .specflow/features/{feature-slug}/
# Files:
#   1-spec.md        - Analyst output
#   2-architecture.md - Architect output
#   3-security.md    - Security (Jordan) output
#   4-cost.md        - Cost (Taylor) output
#   5-test-plan.md   - TEA output
#   6-dev-output.md  - Dev output (optional)
#   7-qa-output.md   - QA output (optional)
#   PROGRESS.md      - Agent work log (append-only)
#   STATUS.md        - PM approval tags
